# M2 flow on the real stages (D-042, D-047, task E12): game over in St.
# Gilgen → „Weiter?" restarts St. Gilgen (not Salzburg) with 3 lives, score
# 0, Oblaten 0. The run starts at Salzburg (start = title), plays
# salzburg_solver.replay unchanged from frame 171, waits on the route map
# and starts St. Gilgen with START at frame 2561 (like
# flow_m2_salzburg_to_st_gilgen). In St. Gilgen it replays the first 375
# frames of st_gilgen_solver.replay (onto the knoll after Gondel A) and then
# holds right off the knoll into the death ravine, three times; START on
# the game-over screen (frame 5037) continues. If either solver route
# changes, re-copy it and re-check the frames.
